{% liquid
assign form_id = 'WoodInquiry-' | append: section.id
assign machine_names = 'CNC configuration advice,CO2 laser for suitable small wood components' | split: ','
%}
<div class="dd-wood">
<section class="dd-wood__hero"><div class="dd-wood__wrap"><nav class="dd-wood__crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#HomeIndustries">Industries</a><span>/</span><span>Furniture &amp; Woodworking</span></nav><div class="dd-wood__split"><div><p class="dd-wood__eyebrow">FURNITURE &amp; WOODWORKING</p><h1>CNC Routing for Furniture Parts &amp; Decorative Woodwork</h1><p class="dd-wood__lead">Plan board cutting, shaped components and decorative routing around your furniture designs. We help you confirm the material, tooling and workholding through sample testing before selecting the equipment.</p><div class="dd-wood__actions"><a class="dd-wood__button" href="#WoodContact">Get a Woodworking Solution</a><a href="#WoodCase">See the Georgia Customer Project →</a></div><p class="dd-wood__note">CNC manufacturing · Free sample testing · Training &amp; technical support</p></div><figure><img src="{{ 'georgia-product-children-cart.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Decorated wooden table from the Georgia customer furniture project" width="1920" height="1080" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" style="object-fit:contain;aspect-ratio:16/9"><figcaption>Finished furniture from our Georgia customer project.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-wood__section"><div class="dd-wood__wrap"><p class="dd-wood__eyebrow">START WITH YOUR FINISHED PARTS</p><h2>What do you want to produce?</h2><div class="dd-wood__grid">
<article class="dd-wood__card"><img src="{{ 'georgia-product-decorative-table.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Shaped plywood storage unit from the Georgia customer project" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:contain"><div class="dd-wood__body"><h3>Shaped plywood components</h3><p>Custom profiles and assembled wood products. Share the component drawings, sheet size and joint details so we can assess the routing process.</p></div></article>
<article class="dd-wood__card">{{ images['cnc-sample-decorative-panel.png'] | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: 'Decorative wooden panel with CNC-routed cut-out details' }}<div class="dd-wood__body"><h3>Decorative panels</h3><p>Cut-out patterns and decorative board details. Match cutter size and holding methods to narrow features and the required finish.</p></div></article>
<article class="dd-wood__card"><img src="{{ 'georgia-product-children-cart.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Finished decorative table showing shaped wooden legs and circular top" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:contain"><div class="dd-wood__body"><h3>Custom furniture parts</h3><p>Profiles that become finished furniture after assembly and finishing. Confirm fit on a sample before committing to the equipment proposal.</p></div></article>
</div><p class="dd-wood__note">Georgia photos show finished customer products, including decoration and assembly. CNC routing is one stage of production; the images do not imply that the CNC machine applies printed graphics or completes all finishing steps.</p></div></section>
<section class="dd-wood__section dd-wood__tint" id="WoodMachine"><div class="dd-wood__wrap dd-wood__split"><figure>{{ images['lz-1325-standard-cutout-v1.png'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: '400,700,1000', sizes: '(min-width:900px) 46vw, 100vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: 'LZ-1325 CNC router with separate control cabinet' }}<figcaption>LZ-1325 CNC Router. Final configuration is confirmed for your application.</figcaption></figure><div><p class="dd-wood__eyebrow">FEATURED CNC ROUTER</p><h2>LZ-1325 for your woodworking workflow</h2><p>A starting point for evaluating board cutting and routed details. The right proposal depends on your material, part geometry and production requirements.</p><ul><li>3.0 kW water-cooled spindle</li><li>Aluminum profile + PVC worktable</li><li>Three-axis CNC control system</li><li>Dust extraction equipment</li><li>Optional vacuum system: vacuum table + vacuum pump</li></ul><a class="dd-wood__button" href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/lz-1325-cnc-router">View LZ-1325 &amp; Get a Quote</a></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-wood__section"><div class="dd-wood__wrap"><h2>Confirm workholding before choosing the table</h2><div class="dd-wood__two"><article class="dd-wood__panel"><h3>Standard aluminum profile + PVC table</h3><p>Plan clamps and fixture positions around the cutter path. Review how each part will stay supported during profile cutting and detailed routing.</p></article><article class="dd-wood__panel"><h3>Optional vacuum table + pump</h3><p>Consider vacuum workholding based on sheet porosity, part size and cut layout. It is an optional system, and its suitability should be checked on your actual job.</p></article></div><p class="dd-wood__note">For small wood components that may suit laser processing, explore the <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/lz-1390-industrial-co2-laser-cutting-machine">LZ-1390 CO2 laser cutter</a>. Material composition, thickness and acceptable edge finish must be reviewed separately.</p></div></section>
<section class="dd-wood__section dd-wood__tint"><div class="dd-wood__wrap dd-wood__split"><div><p class="dd-wood__eyebrow">FROM DRAWING TO SAMPLE</p><h2>Evaluate the part before confirming the machine</h2><p>Send the exact board specification, thickness, largest part size and your drawings. Include assembly details and the finish you expect.</p><a class="dd-wood__button" href="#WoodContact">Request a Free Sample Test</a></div><ol class="dd-wood__steps"><li><h3>01 · Review material and drawings</h3><p>Check sheet dimensions, coatings, shapes, joints and required machining operations.</p></li><li><h3>02 · Select tooling and holding methods</h3><p>Review the cutter, table, fixtures and dust extraction requirements.</p></li><li><h3>03 · Machine and inspect the sample</h3><p>Review the cut profile, routed finish and assembly fit before final configuration.</p></li><li><h3>04 · Confirm equipment and support</h3><p>Agree the specification, quotation, delivery arrangements and training needs for your order.</p></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="dd-wood__section" id="WoodCase"><div class="dd-wood__wrap dd-wood__split"><figure><img src="{{ 'georgia-product-decorative-table.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Custom plywood storage furniture from the Georgia customer project" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Customer product example from the Georgia furniture project.</figcaption></figure><div><p class="dd-wood__eyebrow">GEORGIA · FURNITURE MANUFACTURING</p><h2>From factory testing to customer production</h2><p>The Georgia project documents factory testing, protective packaging, shipment and installation in the customer's workshop. Customer examples include customized plywood products and decorative furniture.</p><p>The case links the equipment delivery to finished woodworking applications.</p><p class="dd-wood__note">This was a customer-specific order. Its historical spindle, table and other options are not the current LZ-1325 standard specification.</p><a class="dd-wood__button" href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/case-study-georgia">Read the Georgia Case Study</a></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-wood__section dd-wood__tint"><div class="dd-wood__wrap dd-wood__split"><div><h2>Support for installation and daily use</h2><p>English manuals and videos, remote installation training, equipment-specific spare parts and technical support help your team prepare for production. On-site training can be arranged for the project.</p><p>Final configuration and delivery timing are agreed for each order.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#HomeFactory">Explore Our Factory &amp; Team →</a></div><div class="dd-wood__faq"><h2>Furniture CNC questions</h2>
<details><summary>Can the LZ-1325 process my plywood or wood board?</summary><p>Send the board specification, thickness and required operations. Tooling, feed strategy and workholding must be selected for the job. A sample test helps confirm the finish before you order.</p></details>
<details><summary>Is the vacuum table standard?</summary><p>No. The regular worktable is aluminum profile + PVC. The optional vacuum system includes a vacuum table and vacuum pump; suitability depends on the material and part layout.</p></details>
<details><summary>Does the router produce the complete finished furniture?</summary><p>The router processes components. Assembly, sanding, decoration and other finishing operations depend on your product and require separate planning.</p></details>
<details><summary>Is the Georgia case configuration the same as the current standard?</summary><p>No. Historical customer projects can have order-specific equipment. Your quotation will state the spindle, table, control system and any options supplied.</p></details>
<details><summary>What should I send for a free sample test?</summary><p>Send drawings, material composition and thickness, part dimensions, assembly requirements and the finish you want. We will confirm the test arrangements; any sample shipping is agreed separately.</p></details>
</div></div></section>
  <section class="dd-wood__section" id="WoodContact"><div class="dd-wood__wrap dd-wood__split"><div><p class="dd-wood__eyebrow">TELL US WHAT YOU WANT TO MAKE</p><h2>Get an equipment proposal for your woodworking workshop</h2><p>Share your material, thickness, finished size and production requirements. We will help you plan the equipment and a free sample test.</p><p><a href="mailto:info@gzcnc-laser.com">info@gzcnc-laser.com</a><br><a href="https://wa.me/8618988946615">WhatsApp: +86 189 8894 6615</a></p><p class="dd-wood__note">Need to share artwork or photos? Send them by email or WhatsApp. Name, email and message are required.</p></div>
    {% form 'contact', id: form_id %}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Source]" value="Furniture and woodworking industry page">
      {% if form.posted_successfully? %}<div class="dd-wood__success" role="status" tabindex="-1" data-wood-success><strong>Thank you — your inquiry has been sent.</strong><p>Our team will review your requirements and contact you by email. You do not need to submit the same inquiry again.</p></div><dialog data-wood-dialog aria-labelledby="WoodSuccessTitle"><h2 id="WoodSuccessTitle">Inquiry sent successfully</h2><p>Thank you for contacting Dragon Diamond. Our team will review your requirements and contact you by email.</p><button type="button" class="dd-wood__button" data-wood-close>Got it</button></dialog>{% endif %}
      {% if form.errors %}<div role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}
      <div class="dd-wood__fields"><div><label for="SignName-{{ section.id }}">Name *</label><input id="SignName-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" value="{{ form.name | escape }}" required></div><div><label for="SignEmail-{{ section.id }}">Email *</label><input id="SignEmail-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[email]" type="email" autocomplete="email" value="{{ form.email | escape }}" required></div><div><label for="SignCompany-{{ section.id }}">Company</label><input id="SignCompany-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Company]" autocomplete="organization" value="{{ form.Company | escape }}"></div><div><label for="SignWA-{{ section.id }}">WhatsApp</label><input id="SignWA-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[WhatsApp]" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" value="{{ form.WhatsApp | escape }}"></div></div>
      <label for="SignProduct-{{ section.id }}">Product Interested</label><select id="SignProduct-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Product Interested]"><option>LZ-1325 CNC Router</option>{% for name in machine_names %}<option>{{ name }}</option>{% endfor %}<option>Other woodworking requirements</option></select>
      <label for="SignMessage-{{ section.id }}">Message *</label><textarea id="SignMessage-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[body]" rows="5" placeholder="Material, thickness, finished size, production needs and destination country..." required>{{ form.body | escape }}</textarea><button type="submit" class="dd-wood__button">Send Inquiry</button>
    {% endform %}
  </div></section>
</div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":{{ request.origin | append: routes.root_url | json }}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Furniture & Woodworking","item":{{ canonical_url | json }}}]}</script>
{% stylesheet %}
.dd-wood{color:#163237;background:#fff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65}.dd-wood *{box-sizing:border-box}.dd-wood__wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:0 32px}.dd-wood__section{padding:76px 0}.dd-wood__tint{background:#eff5f4}.dd-wood__hero{background:#14373b;color:#fff;padding:135px 0 64px}.dd-wood__crumb{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:44px}.dd-wood .dd-wood__hero a{color:#80e0d7}.dd-wood__split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}.dd-wood__hero .dd-wood__split{align-items:center}.dd-wood h1,.dd-wood h2,.dd-wood h3{font-family:var(--font-heading--family,Arial,sans-serif);color:inherit;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.16;margin:0 0 20px}.dd-wood h1{font-size:clamp(36px,3.4vw,54px)}.dd-wood h2{font-size:clamp(28px,2.6vw,38px)}.dd-wood h3{font-size:23px;margin-bottom:14px}.dd-wood p{margin:0 0 20px}.dd-wood__eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:#087d83}.dd-wood__hero .dd-wood__eyebrow{color:#80e0d7}.dd-wood__lead{font-size:19px}.dd-wood__intro{max-width:800px}.dd-wood__actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:28px 0}.dd-wood a{color:#08777b;text-underline-offset:4px}.dd-wood__button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;padding:13px 20px;background:#087c80;color:#fff!important;border:0;border-radius:4px;font:700 15px/1.4 Arial,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:center}.dd-wood__hero .dd-wood__button{background:#74dfd3;color:#10383b!important}.dd-wood figure{margin:0}.dd-wood img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.dd-wood__hero img{aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px}.dd-wood figcaption,.dd-wood__note{font-size:14px;margin-top:18px!important}.dd-wood__hero figcaption{color:#c4dcde}.dd-wood__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px;margin-top:30px}.dd-wood__two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px;margin-top:30px}.dd-wood__card{border:1px solid #d6e2e2;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.dd-wood__card img{aspect-ratio:16/10;object-fit:cover}.dd-wood__body{padding:24px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.dd-wood__body>a:last-child{margin-top:auto}.dd-wood__body ul{padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px}.dd-wood__machine>a{background:#e8f0ef}.dd-wood__machine img{object-fit:contain;padding:18px;aspect-ratio:4/3}.dd-wood__panel{padding:26px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;border-top:3px solid #087f82}.dd-wood__panel p{margin:0}.dd-wood__steps{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-left:2px solid #83c9c5}.dd-wood__steps li{padding:0 0 20px 26px}.dd-wood__steps li:last-child{padding-bottom:0}.dd-wood__steps h3{font-size:21px}.dd-wood__faq details{border-bottom:1px solid #b9cecc}.dd-wood__faq summary{padding:18px 0;min-height:48px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}.dd-wood__faq details p{padding:0 0 16px}.dd-wood__fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 18px}.dd-wood label{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700}.dd-wood input,.dd-wood textarea,.dd-wood select{display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:48px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #a8c0c0;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;color:#163237;font:16px/1.4 Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:18px}.dd-wood textarea{resize:vertical}.dd-wood [id]{scroll-margin-top:125px}.dd-wood :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d18b24;outline-offset:4px}.dd-wood__success{padding:20px;background:#e0f5ee;border:2px solid #087c80;margin-bottom:24px;border-radius:6px}.dd-wood dialog{max-width:520px;width:calc(100% - 32px);padding:30px;border:0;border-radius:10px;color:#163237}.dd-wood dialog::backdrop{background:#082429b3}.dd-wood__two img{object-fit:contain;background:#edf3f2}.dd-wood a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:899px){.dd-wood__wrap{padding:0 22px}.dd-wood__split{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.dd-wood__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dd-wood__section{padding:48px 0}.dd-wood__hero{padding-top:105px}.dd-wood__crumb{margin-bottom:28px}.dd-wood__hero img{aspect-ratio:16/10}.dd-wood__machine img{max-height:310px}.dd-wood__two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dd-wood__body{padding:22px}.dd-wood__actions{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.dd-wood__fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
{% endstylesheet %}
{% javascript %}
function initWoodFeedback(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-wood-dialog]').forEach(dialog=>{if(dialog.dataset.ready)return;dialog.dataset.ready='true';const status=dialog.closest('form').querySelector('[data-wood-success]');dialog.querySelector('[data-wood-close]').addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.close());dialog.addEventListener('close',()=>status.focus());if(typeof dialog.showModal==='function')dialog.showModal();else status.focus();});}
initWoodFeedback();document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load',initWoodFeedback);
{% endjavascript %}
